This week in Linear

Customer requests
Link support conversations and sales calls to issues so your team can see which customers asked for what. Requests roll up by customer and by revenue, so prioritization stops being a guess.

Initiative updates
Initiative owners can post a short weekly update with a health status. Updates appear in a single feed for leadership and can be sent to Slack automatically.

Mobile
The iOS and Android apps are rebuilt on a new rendering engine. Issue lists open in half the time and offline edits sync when you're back online.

Also shipped: SLA reminders in triage, a redesigned keyboard shortcut reference, and GitLab merge request linking.

